{"items":[{"w":"analyse","pos":"v","ar":"يحلّل","ex":"Researchers analysed data from over two thousand students.","col":["analyse data","carefully analyse"],"fam":["analysis (n)","analytical (adj)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"approach","pos":"n","ar":"نهج / أسلوب","ex":"The school has adopted a more practical approach to teaching science.","col":["adopt an approach","a different approach"],"fam":["approach (v)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"assess","pos":"v","ar":"يقيّم","ex":"Examiners assess candidates on four criteria.","col":["assess the impact","fully assess"],"fam":["assessment (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"benefit","pos":"n","ar":"فائدة","ex":"One major benefit of cycling is that it costs nothing.","col":["a major benefit","benefit from"],"fam":["beneficial (adj)","benefit (v)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"concept","pos":"n","ar":"مفهوم","ex":"The concept of recycling is now familiar to most children.","col":["a key concept","grasp a concept"],"fam":["conceptual (adj)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"consist of","pos":"phr","ar":"يتكوّن من","ex":"The test consists of four sections.","col":["consist mainly of","consist entirely of"],"fam":[],"lvl":1},{"w":"crucial","pos":"adj","ar":"حاسم / بالغ الأهمية","ex":"Sleep plays a crucial role in memory.","col":["a crucial role","absolutely crucial"],"fam":["crucially (adv)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"decline","pos":"v","ar":"ينخفض / يتراجع","ex":"The number of visitors declined sharply after 2010.","col":["decline sharply","decline steadily"],"fam":["decline (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"demonstrate","pos":"v","ar":"يُثبت / يوضّح","ex":"The study demonstrates that exercise improves concentration.","col":["clearly demonstrate","demonstrate the need for"],"fam":["demonstration (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"evidence","pos":"n","ar":"دليل","ex":"There is little evidence that the policy has worked.","col":["strong evidence","evidence suggests"],"fam":["evident (adj)","evidently (adv)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"factor","pos":"n","ar":"عامل","ex":"Cost is a major factor in choosing a university.","col":["a key factor","contributing factor"],"fam":[],"lvl":1},{"w":"impact","pos":"n","ar":"تأثير","ex":"Tourism has a significant impact on local culture.","col":["have an impact on","a negative impact"],"fam":["impact (v)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"increase","pos":"v","ar":"يزداد","ex":"The population increased by ten per cent.","col":["increase dramatically","increase gradually"],"fam":["increase (n)","increasingly (adv)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"indicate","pos":"v","ar":"يشير إلى","ex":"The figures indicate a clear upward trend.","col":["clearly indicate","results indicate"],"fam":["indication (n)","indicator (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"issue","pos":"n","ar":"قضية / مسألة","ex":"Traffic is a serious issue in many cities.","col":["a serious issue","address an issue"],"fam":[],"lvl":1},{"w":"maintain","pos":"v","ar":"يحافظ على","ex":"It is difficult to maintain a healthy diet when you are busy.","col":["maintain standards","maintain contact"],"fam":["maintenance (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"majority","pos":"n","ar":"الأغلبية","ex":"The majority of students live off campus.","col":["the vast majority","a small majority"],"fam":["major (adj)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"method","pos":"n","ar":"طريقة","ex":"This method is cheaper but slower.","col":["an effective method","teaching methods"],"fam":["methodology (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"obtain","pos":"v","ar":"يحصل على","ex":"Visitors must obtain a permit before entering.","col":["obtain permission","obtain information"],"fam":["obtainable (adj)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"occur","pos":"v","ar":"يحدث","ex":"Most accidents occur at night.","col":["occur naturally","frequently occur"],"fam":["occurrence (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"proportion","pos":"n","ar":"نسبة","ex":"A large proportion of the budget is spent on transport.","col":["a high proportion","in proportion to"],"fam":["proportional (adj)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"reduce","pos":"v","ar":"يقلّل","ex":"The new law aims to reduce pollution.","col":["significantly reduce","reduce costs"],"fam":["reduction (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"require","pos":"v","ar":"يتطلّب","ex":"The job requires good communication skills.","col":["require attention","be required to"],"fam":["requirement (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"significant","pos":"adj","ar":"كبير / ملحوظ","ex":"There was a significant rise in prices.","col":["a significant increase","statistically significant"],"fam":["significantly (adv)","significance (n)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"source","pos":"n","ar":"مصدر","ex":"Oil was the main source of electricity.","col":["a major source","a reliable source"],"fam":["source (v)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"trend","pos":"n","ar":"اتجاه","ex":"The graph shows a downward trend.","col":["an upward trend","a recent trend"],"fam":["trendy (adj)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"vary","pos":"v","ar":"يتفاوت","ex":"Prices vary from one city to another.","col":["vary considerably","vary widely"],"fam":["variation (n)","various (adj)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"access","pos":"n","ar":"الوصول / إمكانية الوصول","ex":"Many villages still lack access to clean water.","col":["have access to","easy access"],"fam":["accessible (adj)"],"lvl":1},{"w":"advocate","pos":"v","ar":"يدعو إلى / يؤيد","ex":"Some experts advocate a four-day working week.","col":["strongly advocate"],"fam":["advocate (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"allocate","pos":"v","ar":"يخصّص","ex":"The government allocated more money to education.","col":["allocate funds","allocate resources"],"fam":["allocation (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"alternative","pos":"n","ar":"بديل","ex":"Public transport offers an alternative to the car.","col":["a viable alternative","a cheaper alternative"],"fam":["alternatively (adv)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"attribute","pos":"v","ar":"ينسب إلى","ex":"The rise in obesity is often attributed to fast food.","col":["attribute something to"],"fam":["attribution (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"compensate","pos":"v","ar":"يعوّض","ex":"Nothing can compensate for a lack of sleep.","col":["compensate for","fully compensate"],"fam":["compensation (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"comprehensive","pos":"adj","ar":"شامل","ex":"The report provides a comprehensive review of the research.","col"