e next year.","col":["implement a policy","fully implement"],"fam":["implementation (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"inevitable","pos":"adj","ar":"حتمي","ex":"Some job losses are inevitable as technology develops.","col":["almost inevitable","the inevitable result"],"fam":["inevitably (adv)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"justify","pos":"v","ar":"يبرّر","ex":"It is hard to justify spending so much on the stadium.","col":["justify the cost","difficult to justify"],"fam":["justification (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"mitigate","pos":"v","ar":"يخفّف (الأثر)","ex":"Trees can mitigate the effects of heat in cities.","col":["mitigate the impact","mitigate risks"],"fam":["mitigation (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"outweigh","pos":"v","ar":"يفوق (أهميةً)","ex":"The benefits outweigh the drawbacks.","col":["far outweigh","outweigh the risks"],"fam":[],"lvl":2},{"w":"phenomenon","pos":"n","ar":"ظاهرة","ex":"Urban heat islands are a well-known phenomenon.","col":["a natural phenomenon","a recent phenomenon"],"fam":["phenomena (pl)","phenomenal (adj)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"plummet","pos":"v","ar":"يهبط بشدة","ex":"Sales plummeted during the crisis.","col":["plummet to","prices plummeted"],"fam":[],"lvl":2},{"w":"prevalent","pos":"adj","ar":"منتشر / شائع","ex":"Diabetes is becoming more prevalent among young people.","col":["increasingly prevalent"],"fam":["prevalence (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"promote","pos":"v","ar":"يروّج / يعزّز","ex":"The campaign aims to promote healthy eating.","col":["promote awareness","promote growth"],"fam":["promotion (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"reluctant","pos":"adj","ar":"متردد / غير راغب","ex":"Many people are reluctant to change their habits.","col":["reluctant to admit"],"fam":["reluctance (n)","reluctantly (adv)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"sustainable","pos":"adj","ar":"مستدام","ex":"We need more sustainable forms of transport.","col":["sustainable development","environmentally sustainable"],"fam":["sustainability (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"undermine","pos":"v","ar":"يقوّض","ex":"Cheating undermines trust in the education system.","col":["undermine confidence","seriously undermine"],"fam":[],"lvl":2},{"w":"viable","pos":"adj","ar":"قابل للتطبيق","ex":"Solar energy is now a viable alternative to oil.","col":["economically viable","a viable option"],"fam":["viability (n)"],"lvl":2},{"w":"ambiguous","pos":"adj","ar":"غامض / ملتبس","ex":"The wording of the question is ambiguous.","col":["deliberately ambiguous"],"fam":["ambiguity (n)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"coherent","pos":"adj","ar":"متماسك","ex":"A coherent essay has a clear line of argument.","col":["a coherent argument","coherent strategy"],"fam":["coherence (n)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"detrimental","pos":"adj","ar":"ضار","ex":"Excessive screen time can be detrimental to children’s health.","col":["detrimental effect","detrimental to"],"fam":["detriment (n)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"discrepancy","pos":"n","ar":"تناقض / فرق","ex":"There is a discrepancy between the two sets of figures.","col":["a large discrepancy"],"fam":[],"lvl":3},{"w":"exacerbate","pos":"v","ar":"يفاقم","ex":"Building more roads may exacerbate traffic problems.","col":["exacerbate the problem"],"fam":["exacerbation (n)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"feasible","pos":"adj","ar":"ممكن / قابل للتنفيذ","ex":"It is not feasible to build a metro in every town.","col":["technically feasible","economically feasible"],"fam":["feasibility (n)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"hinder","pos":"v","ar":"يعيق","ex":"A lack of funding hindered the research.","col":["seriously hinder","hinder progress"],"fam":["hindrance (n)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"incentive","pos":"n","ar":"حافز","ex":"Tax cuts provide an incentive to invest.","col":["a financial incentive","an incentive to"],"fam":["incentivise (v)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"indispensable","pos":"adj","ar":"لا غنى عنه","ex":"Smartphones have become indispensable for many people.","col":["absolutely indispensable"],"fam":[],"lvl":3},{"w":"inherent","pos":"adj","ar":"متأصّل / ملازم","ex":"There are risks inherent in any new technology.","col":["inherent risks","inherent in"],"fam":["inherently (adv)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"meticulous","pos":"adj","ar":"دقيق جدًا","ex":"The research was carried out with meticulous care.","col":["meticulous attention to detail"],"fam":["meticulously (adv)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"paradox","pos":"n","ar":"مفارقة","ex":"It is a paradox that we are more connected but lonelier.","col":["a strange paradox"],"fam":["paradoxically (adv)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"pragmatic","pos":"adj","ar":"عملي / واقعي","ex":"A pragmatic solution may be better than a perfect one.","col":["a pragmatic approach"],"fam":["pragmatism (n)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"scrutiny","pos":"n","ar":"تدقيق / فحص","ex":"The government’s plans have come under scrutiny.","col":["close scrutiny","come under scrutiny"],"fam":["scrutinise (v)"],"lvl":3},{"w":"substantiate","pos":"v","ar":"يدعم بالأدلة","ex":"The claims have not been substantiated.","col":["substantiate a claim"],"fam":[],"lvl":3},{"w":"unprecedented","pos":"adj","ar":"غير مسبوق","ex":"The city has seen unprecedented growth.","col":["an unprecedented rise","on an unprecedented scale"],"fam":[],"lvl":3}]}